          }
        ],
        "retired": true,
        "retired_reason": "Retired in iteration 2 by the Verifier. The 'dismiss' step after touching assumed the :TOUCH intro and the :MAIN menu are two windows. In the IR program (screens[0].objects[27]) the :TOUCH text runs into :MAIN with no #END in between; a :label is not a command that ends a message, so ZZT shows intro + menu in one window (scenario 1 asserts this). Dismissing that window closes the menu without a choice, so these steps encoded the iteration-1 bug. Replaced by the three '(added in iteration 2)' scenarios."
      },
      {
